<title>USA: Dade County, Fla., sets bond sale for April 28.</title>
<headline>Dade County, Fla., sets bond sale for April 28.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida's Dade County will sell $135 million of aviation revenue refunding bonds on April 28, bond administrator Lidia Monzon-Aguirre said.</p>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc will be senior manager for the negotiated deal.</p>
<p>The issue probably will be sold as two series because some of the bonds to be refunded were private activity bonds subject to the alternative minimum tax, Monzon-Aguirre said.</p>
<p>((--Jane Sutton, 305-3745013))</p>
